# Build context hygiene.
#
# There was no .dockerignore at all, so `COPY . .` pulled the entire working
# tree into the image: data/ is 2.7 GB and results/ is 4.3 GB of local run
# artifacts. Seven gigabytes crossed to the builder for an application whose
# source is under a megabyte, on every build.
#
# The warehouse is deliberately NOT shipped. It is generated from the CSV by
# `make build`, so the image carries the recipe and not the output.

.git
.gitignore
.venv
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Local run artifacts and generated data — regenerated, never shipped.
results/
data/results/
data/*.duckdb
data/*.duckdb.wal
data/cmms.db*
data/exemplars.jsonl
evals/reports/
artifacts/*.png

# Developer surface the container has no use for.
.claude/
.preview/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.DS_Store
*.egg-info
notebooks/
